  "details": "It would be interesting to give us the oportunity to move our hitboxes in the animations os the avatars. For example you make a swordsman avatar and you want to make a really cool front dash, with the current sistem we can move only the model by itself, the hitbox and camera stay at the starting point. Being able to move in unity the camera/hitbox would be something interesting allowing for a lot of new avatar features",
